gcompris-vi (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First .deb package. v0.1.0 shipped the translation and voices as loose
    files; this installs through apt and depends on gcompris-qt-data.
  * Since v0.1.0: Vietnam map with the Hoàng Sa and Trường Sa archipelagos,
    34-province administrative map, and two Làng Maker mini apps
    (lang_maker, lang_doidoi).
  * Patches gcompris-qt-data's .rcc files through dpkg-divert with a trigger,
    so upgrading GCompris no longer drops the Vietnamese localisation.
  * Voices not included yet: 202/888 files done, not tracked in git.

 -- ThingEdu <tuan@rogo.com.vn>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:12:08 +0700
